WEBVTT

00:00:01.040 --> 00:00:03.090
<i>Izumi-kun! Good morning!</i>

00:00:03.090 --> 00:00:06.480
<i>Go out there and do your best 
today! Love-love, Lala-Lulu!</i>

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:09.940
<b>Magical Angel Lala-Lulu</b>

00:00:06.780 --> 00:00:08.820
<i>Izumi-kun! Good morning!</i>

00:00:08.520 --> 00:00:09.940
<b>I'll give my heart to you-lulu!</b>

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:12.650
<i>Go out there and do your best 
today! Love-love, Lala-Lulu!</i>

00:00:12.650 --> 00:00:14.560
<i>Izumi-kun! Good morning!</i>

00:00:14.560 --> 00:00:18.200
<i>Go out there and do your best 
today! Love-love, Lala-Lulu!</i>

00:00:17.360 --> 00:00:19.500
Izumi-san! It's morning!

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:20.400
<i>Izumi-kun! Good morning!</i>

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:21.200
Do you want to be late for class?!

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:24.000
<i>Go out there and do your best 
today! Love-love, Lala-Lulu!</i>

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:26.040
<i>Izumi-kun! Good morning!</i>

00:00:26.040 --> 00:00:27.880
<i>Go out there and do your—</i>

00:00:28.610 --> 00:00:31.250
Izumi! Wake up!

00:00:36.460 --> 00:00:37.960
It's this late already?!

00:00:37.960 --> 00:00:39.890
Why didn't you wake me up?

00:00:40.290 --> 00:00:41.850
I tried more than once!

00:00:42.230 --> 00:00:44.690
You've been oversleeping terribly lately.

00:00:44.690 --> 00:00:47.150
What are you doing, up so late every night?

00:00:47.150 --> 00:00:48.650
What am I doing?

00:00:48.650 --> 00:00:49.820
Isn't it obvious?

00:00:50.180 --> 00:00:51.650
I'm drawing manga!

00:00:53.090 --> 00:00:56.780
In any case, Izumi-san, 
do you know what this is?

00:00:57.360 --> 00:01:00.120
The housekeeper, Ichihara-san, found it 
while she was doing the laundry.

00:01:01.170 --> 00:01:02.660
I forgot about that!

00:01:02.660 --> 00:01:04.650
It's the good-luck charm 
I borrowed from Ryouma!

00:01:04.650 --> 00:01:05.000
Huh?

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:09.550
Good luck charm?

00:01:09.550 --> 00:01:12.750
It just looks like an 
ordinary glass marble to me.

00:01:12.750 --> 00:01:14.550
There's even a crack in it.

00:01:14.890 --> 00:01:17.340
What? A crack?! No way!

00:01:18.130 --> 00:01:19.010
It's true!

00:01:19.620 --> 00:01:21.950
It must have happened 
when I dropped it before.

00:01:27.120 --> 00:01:28.560
Wh-What do I do now?!

00:01:29.310 --> 00:01:31.690
Don't touch me, you cross-dressing pervert!

00:01:31.940 --> 00:01:35.190
How dare a <i>guy</i> make me do 
all those things for him?!

00:01:35.190 --> 00:01:38.320
Talentless posers riding 
your parents' coattails!

00:01:38.320 --> 00:01:41.520
Rei... you couldn't go apologize 
to him for me, could you?

00:01:41.520 --> 00:01:44.330
If I went, he probably 
wouldn't even talk me, so...

00:01:45.240 --> 00:01:47.370
Is that the sort of person you want to be?

00:01:48.930 --> 00:01:52.910
Wouldn't someone on the path 
toward respectable adulthood

00:01:52.910 --> 00:01:55.340
own up to his mistakes 
honestly and apologize?

00:01:55.660 --> 00:01:56.980
Izumi-san,

00:01:56.980 --> 00:02:00.010
if you continue to simply run away 
from anything painful or unpleasant,

00:02:00.010 --> 00:02:04.100
you will never become the kind 
of manga artist you hope to be.

00:02:05.710 --> 00:02:08.560
Nothing will ever change if 
you just run away, you know.

00:02:08.870 --> 00:02:11.350
Y-You're right.

00:02:11.350 --> 00:02:12.770
You're right, Rei.

00:02:13.370 --> 00:02:15.800
How do you think I should apologize?

00:02:16.320 --> 00:02:17.740
Kneel down and kowtow?

00:02:18.060 --> 00:02:20.450
You don't need to make it such a complex matter.

00:02:20.770 --> 00:02:21.770
First and foremost,

00:02:22.270 --> 00:02:24.450
you need to go find a glass 
marble that looks like this one.

00:02:24.950 --> 00:02:25.410
Huh?

00:02:25.410 --> 00:02:28.120
If you return it with a guiltless 
expression, you should be fine.

00:02:29.610 --> 00:02:31.080
What about my path to adulthood?!

00:02:32.080 --> 00:02:35.060
This is what is called "worldly wisdom."

00:02:35.060 --> 00:02:38.510
It is a necessity for navigating 
the real world smoothly.

00:02:38.510 --> 00:02:41.520
Adults are... Adults are...

00:02:41.520 --> 00:02:43.890
Do you have a better idea, then?

00:02:44.150 --> 00:02:45.690
Then do as I say!

00:02:45.690 --> 00:02:48.080
Your true feelings and the method of showing them

00:02:48.080 --> 00:02:51.070
will not agree with each other.

00:02:51.070 --> 00:02:52.600
R-Roger!

00:02:55.680 --> 00:02:58.000
He didn't have to get so frantic over this.

00:02:58.000 --> 00:02:59.740
He really is still a child.

00:03:00.090 --> 00:03:03.440
<i>But that so-called good-luck charm...</i>

00:03:03.440 --> 00:03:06.200
<i>It was nothing but an ordinary, 
unremarkable marble.</i>

00:03:07.110 --> 00:03:08.950
<i>Yet, just believing it was real allowed him</i>

00:03:08.950 --> 00:03:11.120
<i>to give that kind of performance.</i>

00:03:11.480 --> 00:03:14.460
At his core, Izumi is 
actually very expressive.

00:03:15.080 --> 00:03:16.850
<i>I suppose that means...</i>

00:03:16.850 --> 00:03:19.970
<i>...the blood of the Sena family does 
indeed flow through Izumi's veins.</i>

00:05:09.440 --> 00:05:10.710
<i>Izumi?</i>

00:05:15.310 --> 00:05:16.080
Izumi!

00:05:16.080 --> 00:05:17.540
Ryouma-san!

00:05:17.820 --> 00:05:19.000
Izumi!

00:05:19.000 --> 00:05:20.460
Ryouma-san!

00:05:20.690 --> 00:05:21.920
Izumi!

00:05:23.480 --> 00:05:24.090
Izumi!

00:05:39.040 --> 00:05:41.140
Mister... Elephant...

00:05:53.080 --> 00:05:55.080
<b><i>If Only It Had All Been A Dream</i></b>

00:06:01.230 --> 00:06:05.260
<i>I haven't been able to find a 
good replacement for the marble.</i>

00:06:07.120 --> 00:06:08.820
<i>Ten years later...</i>

00:06:11.940 --> 00:06:15.840
<i>In any age, it's your 
one and only wedding.</i>

00:06:16.830 --> 00:06:19.130
<i>That's me, isn't it?</i>

00:06:21.680 --> 00:06:26.640
Oh, it's that commercial! The one 
that shows Ryouma as a child actor!

00:06:26.640 --> 00:06:29.380
Oh, he's so cute!

00:06:29.380 --> 00:06:31.450
Then, is the girl also the 
same as the child actor?

00:06:31.450 --> 00:06:32.840
Probably.

00:06:32.840 --> 00:06:35.890
She's so cute! I wonder if she's a model?

00:06:35.890 --> 00:06:37.000
I don't think I've ever seen her before.

00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:40.130
I wonder if the two of them are dating!

00:06:40.130 --> 00:06:42.210
Aww, that depresses me...

00:06:44.610 --> 00:06:46.110
<i>That commercial...</i>

00:06:46.110 --> 00:06:47.950
<i>I was worried at first,</i>

00:06:47.950 --> 00:06:51.640
<i>wondering what I'd say if someone 
recognized me as that girl, but...</i>

00:06:53.740 --> 00:06:55.810
<i>No one's noticed a thing.</i>

00:06:55.680 --> 00:06:56.600
<b>Zero Aura                                                       Totally Lame</b>

00:06:56.600 --> 00:06:57.860
In the first place,

00:06:57.210 --> 00:06:59.190
<i>But that's totally okay with me!</i>

00:06:57.860 --> 00:07:00.940
Moromi doesn't have enough stage 
presence to play the main heroine.

00:06:59.190 --> 00:07:00.940
<i>I'm gonna be a manga artist, after all!</i>

00:07:00.940 --> 00:07:04.000
You think? I actually like 
Moromi-chan quite a bit.

00:07:01.600 --> 00:07:05.210
<i>My goal is to hit the deadline at the end 
of the month for the Kadoyama Manga Prize!</i>

00:07:04.000 --> 00:07:05.440
Nah, for the main heroine,

00:07:05.210 --> 00:07:06.900
<i>All right! Chapter cover done!</i>

00:07:05.440 --> 00:07:07.390
I feel like Tamari is more 
natural in that kind of role.

00:07:06.900 --> 00:07:08.860
<b>Angel Heart</b>

00:07:06.900 --> 00:07:08.860
<b>The Holy War Between 
Angels and Demons!!</b>

00:07:07.390 --> 00:07:08.860
If it were up to me, I'd have chosen Tamari.

00:07:09.600 --> 00:07:12.020
That's only because Tamari-san fits 
the Glasses Girl archetype, right?

00:07:11.030 --> 00:07:12.950
Sena, what are you drawing?

00:07:12.020 --> 00:07:14.660
Totally. But aren't Glasses Girls the best?

00:07:13.930 --> 00:07:15.200
I-It's a secret!

00:07:14.660 --> 00:07:15.200
Or not?

00:07:15.200 --> 00:07:18.000
Some kind of contest entry? Or a doujinshi?

00:07:15.200 --> 00:07:18.000
Moromi-chan wore glasses in episode six, too.

00:07:18.000 --> 00:07:21.000
I did like that episode. That was the 
highlight of the season, I think.

00:07:18.260 --> 00:07:21.000
I said it's a secret! Don't look at it!

00:07:21.000 --> 00:07:23.510
I liked the receptionist that appeared 
briefly in that episode as well.

00:07:23.510 --> 00:07:25.390
I hope she'll make another appearance.

00:07:25.390 --> 00:07:27.970
Huh? You didn't find her kind of gaudy?

00:07:27.970 --> 00:07:29.120
No, not that one.

00:07:27.970 --> 00:07:30.510
<i>I'm still keeping it a secret 
from Kuroi-kun and the guys.</i>

00:07:29.120 --> 00:07:31.410
The one sitting next to her, who 
was only half on the screen.

00:07:30.510 --> 00:07:33.140
<i>And then, when I win the prize, I...</i>

00:07:31.410 --> 00:07:33.140
Futoyama-kun—

00:07:33.140 --> 00:07:37.010
<b>Kadoyama Shoten Youngster 
Newcomer Manga Prize</b>

00:07:37.280 --> 00:07:40.020
And the prize goes to... Sena Izumi-kun!

00:07:46.980 --> 00:07:49.220
And anyway, Kouji, you say you like Moromi,

00:07:49.220 --> 00:07:50.300
so isn't that unreasonable?

00:07:49.570 --> 00:07:52.400
<i>You're making a crazy face again, Sena...</i>

00:07:50.300 --> 00:07:51.430
But she's really cute.

00:07:51.430 --> 00:07:52.400
But why?

00:07:52.770 --> 00:07:55.870
Tamari is way, way cuter than Moromi... huh?

00:07:58.560 --> 00:08:01.910
Don't mind him. If we comment, we lose.

00:08:04.160 --> 00:08:05.880
Ichijou-san is arriving on set!

00:08:06.320 --> 00:08:07.340
Good morning.

00:08:07.690 --> 00:08:09.470
Good morning!

00:08:10.560 --> 00:08:12.240
Ichijou-san, good morning.

00:08:12.680 --> 00:08:14.400
Director, thanks for having me.

00:08:14.400 --> 00:08:16.180
So for today's shoot,

00:08:16.180 --> 00:08:18.490
we're starting with the scene where 
your character, Detective Suzuki,

00:08:18.490 --> 00:08:20.680
tails the suspect to confirm where he lives.

00:08:21.140 --> 00:08:22.000
Right.

00:08:22.000 --> 00:08:24.160
There, he'll see the suspect 
drop his cold facade

00:08:24.160 --> 00:08:26.730
while unguarded and interacting 
with his family,

00:08:26.730 --> 00:08:28.440
and feel surprised and a little troubled.

00:08:28.790 --> 00:08:30.450
So please run with that.

00:08:30.450 --> 00:08:32.320
Right. I'll do my best.

00:08:32.320 --> 00:08:34.150
Hi, Ryouma-kun.

00:08:34.450 --> 00:08:36.160
Looking forward to today.

00:08:36.160 --> 00:08:38.620
I am as well. Thanks for 
working with me today.

00:08:38.970 --> 00:08:41.650
I'm Kurio Nene from Ashika Productions.

00:08:41.650 --> 00:08:44.120
Thank you for working with me today.

00:08:44.810 --> 00:08:46.630
Right... Thanks to you, too.

00:08:48.380 --> 00:08:50.630
<b>Filming</b>

00:08:49.680 --> 00:08:50.630
Action!

00:09:08.110 --> 00:09:10.140
Daddy! Welcome home!

00:09:10.140 --> 00:09:12.420
Ah! Did you take good care 
of the house while I was out?

00:09:12.420 --> 00:09:13.070
Yep!

00:09:13.350 --> 00:09:15.410
I see. Good girl!

00:09:20.000 --> 00:09:21.140
Guess what, guess what!

00:09:21.140 --> 00:09:24.120
Today at school, my teacher 
did something amazing!

00:09:27.030 --> 00:09:28.830
All right, great expression.

00:09:37.350 --> 00:09:38.510
Cut! Cut!

00:09:38.510 --> 00:09:40.500
Are you all right, Ichijou-san?!

00:09:40.500 --> 00:09:41.680
Do you want to take a short break?

00:09:42.620 --> 00:09:45.140
Hey, are you okay? That was some bang!

00:09:45.140 --> 00:09:46.670
I'm fine.

00:09:46.670 --> 00:09:49.180
I was just a little too 
absorbed in the role.

00:09:49.180 --> 00:09:52.190
I apologize. Can we do it again?

00:09:52.770 --> 00:09:53.530
Sorry about that.

00:09:53.860 --> 00:09:55.480
It's totally okay!

00:09:55.480 --> 00:09:56.740
Please don't worry about it.

00:09:59.710 --> 00:10:01.420
I'm sorry, Director.

00:10:01.420 --> 00:10:02.990
Would you let me run it again right now?

00:10:03.430 --> 00:10:06.200
Okay, then. All right, let's do take two!

00:10:06.200 --> 00:10:07.210
<b>Filming</b>

00:10:11.810 --> 00:10:12.290
Again?!

00:10:12.290 --> 00:10:13.880
Cut! Cut!

00:10:15.210 --> 00:10:18.940
It was nice of the director to 
change the script. Lucky us!

00:10:18.940 --> 00:10:22.980
I don't think it added anything to the scene

00:10:22.980 --> 00:10:25.020
to show you walking away anyway.

00:10:26.310 --> 00:10:28.720
You've been really busy lately, after all.

00:10:28.720 --> 00:10:30.650
Luckily, there's nothing 
else on today's schedule,

00:10:30.650 --> 00:10:32.560
so you can just take your time and relax.

00:10:34.580 --> 00:10:36.030
<i>Ten years later...</i>

00:10:37.160 --> 00:10:40.490
<i>In any age, it's your 
one and only wedding.</i>

00:10:40.770 --> 00:10:45.040
<i>No... It's not that I'm getting 
run down or anything.</i>

00:10:47.280 --> 00:10:49.610
<i>The problem is, every time 
I let my guard down,</i>

00:10:49.610 --> 00:10:51.700
<i>his face comes floating into my head!</i>

00:10:51.700 --> 00:10:52.830
<i>Even today...</i>

00:10:52.830 --> 00:10:55.640
<i>There was something about that 
girl that reminded me of him.</i>

00:10:58.420 --> 00:10:59.300
Ryouma-san!

00:11:02.450 --> 00:11:04.430
<i>Damn it! I slipped again!</i>

00:11:04.970 --> 00:11:08.550
<i>Even though he's a guy! 
And a cross-dressing pervert!</i>

00:11:08.550 --> 00:11:09.890
<i>And a no-talent coattail-rider!</i>

00:11:11.150 --> 00:11:13.760
<i>But I guess ten years' worth of feelings</i>

00:11:13.760 --> 00:11:15.900
<i>don't go away overnight.</i>

00:11:17.400 --> 00:11:18.650
<i>Damn it!</i>

00:11:19.110 --> 00:11:21.940
Ryouma-san? Ryouma-san!

00:11:21.940 --> 00:11:22.570
Huh?

00:11:23.070 --> 00:11:24.450
We've arrived at your house.

00:11:28.450 --> 00:11:29.870
<i>House...</i>

00:11:30.400 --> 00:11:32.080
Seiya-san, Nagisa-san.

00:11:32.400 --> 00:11:34.310
We should be heading out soon.

00:11:34.310 --> 00:11:35.540
Are you ready?

00:11:36.410 --> 00:11:37.840
All set!

00:11:37.840 --> 00:11:38.870
Me, too.

00:11:38.870 --> 00:11:42.100
Yay! I love parties so much!

00:11:42.680 --> 00:11:44.380
Well then, madame.

00:11:44.380 --> 00:11:46.850
Will you do me the honor of 
allowing me to escort you?

00:11:47.090 --> 00:11:49.400
Oh, my. Gladly!

00:11:52.200 --> 00:11:53.050
Yes?

00:11:53.050 --> 00:11:54.480
<i>I apologize for not calling ahead.</i>

00:11:54.480 --> 00:11:55.440
<i>It's Ichijou Ryouma.</i>

00:11:56.440 --> 00:11:57.570
Good morning.

00:11:59.290 --> 00:12:00.720
My, it's been a while!

00:12:00.720 --> 00:12:03.040
Not since filming the commercial!

00:12:03.040 --> 00:12:04.500
You seem to be quite busy these days.

00:12:04.500 --> 00:12:05.760
I do hope you're getting enough rest.

00:12:05.760 --> 00:12:09.200
But what brings you to 
our home out of the blue?

00:12:10.180 --> 00:12:11.510
To be honest...

00:12:11.510 --> 00:12:16.840
I remembered that I lent Izumi-san 
a very important good-luck charm.

00:12:16.840 --> 00:12:19.500
Oh, we're terribly sorry.

00:12:19.500 --> 00:12:23.400
You can feel free to wait here 
until he gets back from school.

00:12:23.400 --> 00:12:24.340
Thank you very much.

00:12:24.650 --> 00:12:27.630
Nagisa and I have plans this evening,
 so we'll be stepping out,

00:12:27.630 --> 00:12:28.850
but please make yourself at home.

00:12:28.850 --> 00:12:31.110
P-Please wait a moment.

00:12:31.110 --> 00:12:32.960
Izumi-san has his 
club activities this evening,

00:12:32.960 --> 00:12:34.730
and won't be home until quite late.

00:12:34.730 --> 00:12:36.980
Don't be silly. Just call him home early.

00:12:36.980 --> 00:12:40.360
But we can't have Ryouma-san 
waiting here by himself!

00:12:40.360 --> 00:12:43.900
Oh, he can handle being home alone 
for a little while, can't he?

00:12:43.900 --> 00:12:46.390
Certainly. Please don't mind me.

00:12:46.390 --> 00:12:48.160
That's not the issue!

00:12:48.160 --> 00:12:50.490
Well, let's not stand around talking here.

00:12:50.490 --> 00:12:53.130
Absolutely! Come in, come in!

00:12:53.130 --> 00:12:54.860
This is the living room over here.

00:12:54.860 --> 00:12:55.750
Thanks for having me.

00:12:55.750 --> 00:12:57.570
Would you like something to eat?

00:12:57.570 --> 00:13:00.050
I wonder if Ichihara-san's gone home already...

00:13:00.050 --> 00:13:02.710
In that case, we can order something!

00:13:02.710 --> 00:13:04.420
Ryouma-kun, what would you like to eat?

00:13:04.420 --> 00:13:06.370
Chinese? French cuisine?

00:13:06.370 --> 00:13:08.850
I'm fine. Please don't trouble yourself.

00:13:08.850 --> 00:13:09.930
<i>Izumi-san...</i>

00:13:09.930 --> 00:13:12.890
I have to go with Sanso. 
Yep, Sanso. She's so moe!

00:13:11.890 --> 00:13:16.420
<i>Hmm... "Mwa ha ha ha, I've been 
waiting for this moment!"</i>

00:13:12.890 --> 00:13:14.480
Natorium is great, too!

00:13:14.480 --> 00:13:16.420
She and Sanso really match, don't they?

00:13:16.420 --> 00:13:18.310
Those two as a combo are seriously awesome!

00:13:16.420 --> 00:13:21.070
<i>"That's my line!" What should come next?</i>

00:13:18.310 --> 00:13:21.070
Enso is too crude to be with them.

00:13:21.070 --> 00:13:22.410
Aren't they being paired up next?

00:13:22.410 --> 00:13:25.510
Enso-san is going solo. 
Suiso is too, actually.

00:13:25.080 --> 00:13:26.780
Rei? I wonder what's up.

00:13:25.510 --> 00:13:29.010
She's a dangerous one. 
Especially when she's with Sanso...

00:13:27.440 --> 00:13:29.010
<i>Come home right now!!</i>

00:13:29.010 --> 00:13:32.370
<i>Ryouma's at the house asking 
for his marble back.</i>

00:13:32.370 --> 00:13:36.340
<i>We're heading out for work now, 
so I'll leave the rest to you.</i>

00:13:36.340 --> 00:13:40.230
<i>P.S. Guess there's no choice but 
to come clean and apologize.</i>

00:13:40.230 --> 00:13:41.250
<i>Good luck!</i>

00:13:48.070 --> 00:13:50.720
<i>The person you are trying to reach 
cannot come to the phone.</i>

00:13:50.030 --> 00:13:50.720
<i>No way!</i>

00:13:51.120 --> 00:13:53.440
And then, you won't believe it,

00:13:51.670 --> 00:13:52.560
<i>Why?!</i>

00:13:53.440 --> 00:13:57.640
right in the middle of the backdrop, 
there was this giant hole—

00:13:54.420 --> 00:13:56.990
<i>Why aren't you picking up, Rei?!</i>

00:13:57.870 --> 00:13:59.530
<i>Ryouma's at our house...</i>

00:14:00.130 --> 00:14:03.570
<i>and I haven't found a 
replacement marble yet...</i>

00:14:03.570 --> 00:14:05.570
<i>What do I do now?!</i>

00:14:13.390 --> 00:14:15.560
<i>Things couldn't have gone 
better, if I do say so myself!</i>

00:14:15.560 --> 00:14:18.050
<i>The story about the marble was a sham!</i>

00:14:18.050 --> 00:14:20.840
<i>My true objective is to see Izumi one more time,</i>

00:14:20.840 --> 00:14:23.290
<i>and expel my feelings once and for all!</i>

00:14:23.750 --> 00:14:27.680
<i>I'll erase this illusion that 
I've held onto for ten years.</i>

00:14:27.680 --> 00:14:30.890
<i>And then, I'll move forward!</i>

00:14:32.240 --> 00:14:33.340
<i>He's here!</i>

00:14:36.710 --> 00:14:38.170
<i>What am I doing?</i>

00:14:39.050 --> 00:14:40.020
Ryouma-san!

00:14:40.320 --> 00:14:41.510
I'm so sorry!

00:14:41.510 --> 00:14:44.020
There are cracks in your good-luck charm now!

00:14:46.110 --> 00:14:46.910
Huh?

00:14:47.550 --> 00:14:50.260
I hear a voice, but... where is he?

00:14:51.120 --> 00:14:53.370
Um... I'm Izumi...

00:14:53.760 --> 00:14:54.870
Huh?!

00:14:54.870 --> 00:14:57.330
What?!

00:14:54.870 --> 00:14:57.330
<b>WHAAAAAAAAAAAT?!</b>

00:14:57.330 --> 00:14:59.120
Impossible!

00:14:59.120 --> 00:15:00.920
Izumi wasn't a dweeby little kid like you!

00:15:01.180 --> 00:15:03.630
Nope... this is the real me.

00:15:03.930 --> 00:15:06.680
What?! You liar! Imposter!

00:15:06.680 --> 00:15:07.380
Show me your face!

00:15:12.720 --> 00:15:14.510
<i>It's really him...</i>

00:15:14.510 --> 00:15:16.080
<i>How could this be?</i>

00:15:16.080 --> 00:15:19.410
<i>My Izumi was this dweeby kid the whole time?</i>

00:15:19.410 --> 00:15:21.730
<i>And despite that, I felt my heart 
skip a beat when I saw him?!</i>

00:15:22.240 --> 00:15:24.270
<i>No! I've got to end this now!</i>

00:15:27.000 --> 00:15:29.330
Please! Take off your clothes!

00:15:30.210 --> 00:15:31.280
Huh?

00:15:31.280 --> 00:15:33.280
What?!

00:15:31.280 --> 00:15:33.280
<b>WHAAAAAAAAAAAT?!</b>

00:15:33.280 --> 00:15:35.100
Wh-What are you saying?

00:15:35.100 --> 00:15:36.910
Shut up! Just strip already!

00:15:37.120 --> 00:15:38.720
No! Pervert!

00:15:38.720 --> 00:15:41.400
Last time, I only saw it for 
a second, so it didn't work!

00:15:42.970 --> 00:15:46.130
This time, I'll burn the fact 
that you're a guy into my eyes!

00:15:46.440 --> 00:15:48.330
I'll sever these feelings 
I've had for ten whole years!

00:15:48.330 --> 00:15:49.970
Please, let me disillusion myself!

00:15:50.220 --> 00:15:51.440
No!

00:15:51.440 --> 00:15:52.880
All right, this should do the tr—

00:16:02.890 --> 00:16:05.860
Please... Stop...

00:16:32.820 --> 00:16:33.720
<i>Sweet...</i>

00:16:35.910 --> 00:16:37.190
<i>So sweet...</i>

00:16:39.460 --> 00:16:41.700
<i>I want to devour all of him...</i>

00:16:45.990 --> 00:16:46.980
<i>More...</i>

00:16:49.740 --> 00:16:50.900
<i>More...</i>

00:16:55.930 --> 00:16:57.020
<i>More!</i>

00:16:58.820 --> 00:16:59.950
Stop right there!

00:17:00.380 --> 00:17:01.410
Onii-chan!

00:17:01.410 --> 00:17:02.870
Sh-Shougo?!

00:17:03.180 --> 00:17:05.410
Now this is a surprise.

00:17:05.410 --> 00:17:09.500
So you do guys too, huh, Ryouma?

00:17:09.840 --> 00:17:12.770
Huh? Uh, n-no, this is—

00:17:12.770 --> 00:17:16.420
In that case, you shouldn't 
mind taking me on, right?

00:17:22.110 --> 00:17:23.230
A dream...

00:17:26.520 --> 00:17:29.200
Oh, it was all a dream!

00:17:29.200 --> 00:17:30.730
Thank goodness.

00:17:46.830 --> 00:17:48.960
If only it had just been a dream...

00:17:49.680 --> 00:17:52.420
You've finished the mixdown 
for the album, I trust?

00:17:52.420 --> 00:17:56.880
Of course! We've made 
yet another amazing album!

00:17:57.340 --> 00:17:59.880
I find that rather hard to believe...

00:18:03.350 --> 00:18:07.150
This is Ichijou Ryouma's good-luck charm.

00:18:07.150 --> 00:18:09.220
I thought Izumi had it.

00:18:09.220 --> 00:18:11.120
What's it doing here?

00:18:11.120 --> 00:18:14.610
Oh, he must have dropped 
it in the struggle...

00:18:14.610 --> 00:18:15.440
"In the struggle?"

00:18:15.750 --> 00:18:16.650
Oops.

00:18:16.960 --> 00:18:18.770
Come to think of it,

00:18:18.770 --> 00:18:21.370
Izumi has seemed a bit 
odd the past few days...

00:18:21.850 --> 00:18:24.610
He hasn't eaten anything 
or gotten out of bed.

00:18:24.610 --> 00:18:27.960
He's showed no signs of wanting to go 
to class or to his manga club...

00:18:28.200 --> 00:18:30.080
What happened? Tell me!

00:18:30.080 --> 00:18:32.040
<b>Explanation</b>

00:18:30.080 --> 00:18:32.040
<b>of Circumstances</b>

00:18:32.610 --> 00:18:34.800
Izumi was assaulted by Ichijou Ryouma?

00:18:35.050 --> 00:18:36.150
Yeah.

00:18:36.150 --> 00:18:38.350
And that's why he's locked 
himself in his room?

00:18:38.350 --> 00:18:40.990
Seriously, if I hadn't shown up 
when I did to check on him,

00:18:40.990 --> 00:18:43.260
things would've gotten really bad...

00:18:43.920 --> 00:18:45.950
And I was the one who let 
Ryouma into the house

00:18:45.950 --> 00:18:48.480
and texted Izumi to come home...

00:18:48.960 --> 00:18:50.440
I was far too trusting...

00:18:50.440 --> 00:18:52.290
Seriously, Rei!

00:18:52.290 --> 00:18:56.200
Just think what would've happened 
if my Izumi Sense hadn't gone off!

00:18:57.090 --> 00:19:00.700
But I never would have thought Ichijou 
Ryouma was so serious about all this.

00:19:01.270 --> 00:19:02.620
And actually, Shougo...

00:19:02.620 --> 00:19:05.370
how could you fail to mention 
something as important as this to me?

00:19:05.370 --> 00:19:06.240
Eh?

00:19:06.240 --> 00:19:10.920
Well, I just thought Izumi wouldn't 
like it if I told people what happened.

00:19:10.920 --> 00:19:13.030
Hmm... You're right about that.

00:19:14.030 --> 00:19:15.610
Poor thing...

00:19:15.610 --> 00:19:18.970
He's probably pretty shaken up 
over what happened.

00:19:18.970 --> 00:19:21.520
Whatever he does, whatever he wears,

00:19:21.520 --> 00:19:23.690
whatever he says, he's just so darn cute!

00:19:23.690 --> 00:19:28.820
He's so cute I just want 
to eat him right up!

00:19:28.820 --> 00:19:29.980
Like, seriously!

00:19:31.150 --> 00:19:35.020
Though, these past few years, 
his vibe's changed a little...

00:19:35.020 --> 00:19:36.940
It doesn't change the fact that

00:19:36.940 --> 00:19:38.300
he's still the cutest 
thing in the entire world!

00:19:38.300 --> 00:19:39.240
Totally!

00:19:41.990 --> 00:19:44.220
And he dared to treat the 
adorable Izumi that way!

00:19:44.220 --> 00:19:47.330
Ryouma-kun... next time we meet, 
I won't show you any mercy!

00:19:48.510 --> 00:19:49.680
That reminds me,

00:19:49.680 --> 00:19:53.920
you'll be doing tomorrow's taping for 
the T-1 Grand Prix with Ichijou Ryouma.

00:19:53.920 --> 00:19:56.580
Ah-hah! See how fortune aids me!

00:19:56.580 --> 00:19:58.880
As his older brother, I will 
avenge him with these hands!

00:19:58.880 --> 00:19:59.990
Absolutely not.

00:19:59.990 --> 00:20:01.140
Huh?

00:20:01.140 --> 00:20:02.530
You will refrain from fighting,

00:20:02.530 --> 00:20:04.430
or even verbally confronting 
Ichijou Ryouma at the shoot.

00:20:04.760 --> 00:20:06.490
But why?

00:20:06.490 --> 00:20:09.430
Rei, don't you feel bad for Izumi?

00:20:09.990 --> 00:20:12.640
That's a separate matter entirely.

00:20:12.640 --> 00:20:14.150
You need to play nice with 
the current heartthrob.

00:20:14.400 --> 00:20:16.110
What?!

00:20:18.640 --> 00:20:20.490
Shougo-san is arriving on set!

00:20:20.490 --> 00:20:22.920
Good morning!

00:20:23.400 --> 00:20:26.990
Looking forward to taping today—WISH!

00:20:33.100 --> 00:20:35.550
<i>Rei ordered me not to get into a fight,</i>

00:20:35.550 --> 00:20:39.420
<i>but I could never forgive 
Ryouma-kun for hurting Izumi!</i>

00:20:39.720 --> 00:20:41.840
Ichijou Ryouma-san is arriving on set!

00:20:42.290 --> 00:20:42.720
<i>Here he is!</i>

00:20:44.250 --> 00:20:48.760
Good... morn... ing...

00:20:49.250 --> 00:20:50.600
R-Ryouma-kun?!

00:20:50.860 --> 00:20:53.560
What's wrong? You kind of 
look like a ghost today...

00:20:55.630 --> 00:20:57.230
Shougo-oniisan?

00:20:57.230 --> 00:20:59.780
<i>S-Shougo-oniisan?</i>

00:21:00.380 --> 00:21:03.070
Ryouma-kun, what in the world—

00:21:06.960 --> 00:21:08.570
Help me, please!

00:21:08.570 --> 00:21:09.680
H-Hey, wait a—

00:21:09.680 --> 00:21:12.270
Ryouma-kun! What, what, what! Hold on!

00:21:12.270 --> 00:21:13.910
This is problematic—WISH!

00:21:26.760 --> 00:21:30.220
<b>Magical Angel Lala-Lulu</b>

00:21:26.760 --> 00:21:30.220
<b>I'll give my heart to you-lulu!</b>

00:23:20.610 --> 00:23:21.920
Don't be ridiculous!

00:23:21.920 --> 00:23:23.040
I get it, I get it.

00:23:23.040 --> 00:23:24.270
No bedrooms!

00:23:24.270 --> 00:23:25.090
Why are you saying that now?

00:23:25.090 --> 00:23:27.560
It's my life! Don't interfere with it!

00:23:27.560 --> 00:23:29.000
I figured it'd be something like this.

00:23:29.000 --> 00:23:32.680
It was so fun! My heart didn't miss a beat!

00:23:32.680 --> 00:23:34.220
But I do like you.

00:23:32.680 --> 00:23:34.970
<b><i>But I Do Like You</i></b>

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:39.980
My friend from the Manga Club 
at my college! He's a precious 
person of mine!
